# Server-only resume processing

- PDF/DOCX parsing (`extractText`, `pdf-parse`, `mammoth`) runs in `server/` only.
- Image/Canva PDFs: selected AI provider document vision via base64 PDF bytes — see `multimodal-resume-parsing.mdc`.
- AI calls only in `server/utils/gemini*.ts` or `server/utils/claude*.ts`, selected by `server/utils/aiProvider.ts`. Use private `runtimeConfig.geminiApiKey` / `runtimeConfig.anthropicApiKey` only.
- Client uploads via `multipart` to `POST /api/parse`; receives structured fields, not full extracted text by default.

Do not add client-side AI keys or send full resume text to third parties from the browser.
